---
description: Commit messages must not name AI providers, models, or agents
alwaysApply: true
---

# Commit messages

Write human-style messages about the change only.

Never include Claude, Cursor, Codex, GPT, Anthropic, OpenAI, Copilot, Gemini, `Co-authored-by` for those, `Claude-Session`, or “generated by/with”.

If a hook or wrapper appends a trailer, strip it before the commit succeeds. Do not pass `--no-verify`.
